{"title":"Career Roadmap: DevOps Engineer","role":"DevOps Engineer","summary":"A DevOps Engineer connects software development and IT operations by automating software delivery, infrastructure provisioning, deployments, monitoring, security and reliability.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"CSE – Cloud Computing"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build, deploy, automate, monitor and maintain reliable software delivery infrastructure"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A DevOps Engineer connects software development and IT operations by automating software delivery, infrastructure provisioning, deployments, monitoring, security and reliability."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSE – Cloud Computing student, the roadmap should progress from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Programming","Linux","Networking","Git","Cloud","CI/CD","Containers","Infrastructure as Code","Kubernetes","Observability","DevSecOps","Platform Engineering/SRE"]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year-by-Year Roadmap"},{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Progress","Gap It Moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Programming + Linux fundamentals"},{"text":"Python Documentation · Linux Foundation Training","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"text":"GitHub programs, Linux CLI exercises, small automation scripts"},{"text":"Programming + OS fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Git, networking, Linux administration, cloud basics"},{"text":"Git Documentation · AWS Training","url":"https://git-scm.com/doc"},{"text":"Git projects, deployed cloud application, networking labs"},{"text":"Infrastructure + cloud"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"CI/CD + Docker + Infrastructure as Code"},{"text":"GitHub Actions · Docker Documentation · Terraform 