ance routes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GATE"},{"text":"university-specific admissions"},{"text":"institute-specific entrance processes"},{"text":"CUET-PG for applicable programs"}]},{"type":"p","text":"GATE Official Website\nNTA CUET-PG","url":"https://gate2026.iitg.ac.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and admission rules should be checked for the specific institution and admission year."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations for cloud/DevOps-related postgraduate study include:"},{"type":"table","header":["Country","Relevant Master's Areas"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Computer Science, Cloud Computing, Distributed Systems"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Computer Science, Software Engineering, Cloud/Systems"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Computer Science, Distributed Systems, IT"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Cloud Computing, Cyber Security, Computer Science"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Computer Science, Software Engineering, Cloud"}],[{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Cloud Computing, Computer Science, DevOps-related programs"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Computer Science, Systems, Software Engineering"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Look for programs containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Distributed Systems"},{"text":"Cloud Computing"},{"text":"Computer Networks"},{"text":"Operating Systems"},{"text":"Software Engineering"},{"text":"Systems Engineering"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Site Reliability"},{"text":"High Performance Computing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Application Pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"bachelor's transcripts"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"recommendation letters"},{"text":"projects/GitHub"},{"text":"IELTS/TOEFL where required"},{"text":"GRE where required"},{"text":"financial documents"},{"text":"passport"},{"text":"university-specific application materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarship/Funding Routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore country and university-specific scholarships, including:"},{"type":"p","text":"DAAD Scholarships\nFulbright-Nehru Programs\nChevening Scholarships\nStudy Australia","url":"https://www.daad.de/en/"},{"type":"p","text":"Scholarship eligibility, deadlines and funding conditions should be checked for the specific intake."}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A possible progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps Intern","Junior DevOps / Cloud Engineer","DevOps Engineer","Senior DevOps Engineer","Senior Cloud / Platform Engineer / SRE","Lead / Principal Engineer","DevOps / Platform / SRE Architect","Engineering Manager / Infrastructure Leader"]},{"type":"p","text":"Other technical directions include:"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps","SRE","Platform Engineering"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps","Cloud Architecture","Infrastructure Architecture"]},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"flow","items":["DevOps","DevSecOps","Cloud Security"]}]},{"heading":"Long-Term Relevance: 2030–2046","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Potential Direction","Check the official site"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Cloud + CI/CD + containers + IaC"},{"text":"Current foundation"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Kubernetes, platform engineering, SRE"},{"text":"Technology evolution"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Autonomous infrastructure, advanced observability, AI-assisted operations"},{"text":"Future development"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-native infrastructure, autonomous cloud platforms, distributed computing"},{"text":"Future development"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The long-term skill should therefore not be “knowing one DevOps tool.”"},{"type":"p","text":"It should be the ability to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["design infrastructure","automate it","deploy software","secure it","observe it","troubleshoot it","scale it","optimize cost","i